    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "DILUTION If\nyou invest in our ordinary shares, your interest will be immediately diluted $1.35 per ordinary share, representing the difference\nbetween the price paid by investors in this offering based on the assumed initial public offering price per ordinary share of $0.7018\nand our pro forma as adjusted net tangible book value per ordinary share of $(0.65). Dilution results from the fact that the\ninitial public offering price per ordinary share is substantially in excess of the pro forma as adjusted book value per ordinary share\nattributable to the existing shareholders of our presently outstanding ordinary shares. Our\nnet tangible book value of the Company as of June 30, 2023 was $(53,303,839) or $(1.05) per ordinary share. Net tangible\nbook value represents the amount of our total consolidated tangible assets, less the amount of our total consolidated liabilities. Total\ntangible asse",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
